 Responsible for the proper performance of all tasks that are assigned to them by the Operational ROV Supervisor during the operation, maintenance, repair, and preparations of the ROV;
 Adhere to the DOF Personal Record of Competence;
 Ensure that the proper internal and external Quality, Safety, Health, and Environment requirements are implemented during tasks;
