 Be familiar with the ROV system;
 Operate and maintain the ROV system in accordance with procedures and standards.
 Key Competencies (knowledge, training/education, behaviours): 
 Previous experience with work class ROV systems;
 Post-secondary education* with a primary focus in:
 ROV (Remote Operated Vehicles)
 Electrical
 Engineering Technology
 Mechanic
 Equivalent/related experience or training will be considered
 Working knowledge of Technical Specifications and Standards within the renewables Industry;
 Level of technical knowledge in computer and electronic interfacing;
 Experience with technical testing and troubleshooting;
 Proficient in Microsoft Office Suite - Word/Excel/PowerPoint;
 Excellent interpersonal and organizational skills with the ability to multitask under pressure;
 Excellent communicator including language proficiency (reading/writing);
